 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "30 minutes. We had him talking about role models, going from pixels to actions.",
   "start": 0,
   "end": 5.82
  },
  {
   "text": "We had Dylan talking about building agents on owned versus rented land.",
   "start": 5.88,
   "end": 10.74
  },
  {
   "text": "And then we have Frank talking about how they think about leoparding implied AI as it relates to making decisions around investments.",
   "start": 10.8,
   "end": 18.3
  },
  {
   "text": "First of all, let's just give around a bit of applause to all the speakers.",
   "start": 18.36,
   "end": 23.28
  },
  {
   "text": "It definitely made the event possible, you know, it's like...",
   "start": 23.28,
   "end": 27.18
  },
  {
   "text": "And then, huge final housekeeping items before we close out the day.",
   "start": 28.56,
   "end": 34.2
  },
  {
   "text": "First, very important one.",
   "start": 34.26,
   "end": 36.54
  },
  {
   "text": "Go speak to humans.",
   "start": 36.6,
   "end": 37.62
  },
  {
   "text": "That is how keeping that in blood.",
   "start": 37.68,
   "end": 39.84
  },
  {
   "text": "There's been incredible content covered today.",
   "start": 39.9,
   "end": 42.66
  },
  {
   "text": "Again, that is surface area for you to be able to connect with others and live in Edge City by having it, to actually stimulating conversations.",
   "start": 43.26,
   "end": 50.94
  },
  {
   "text": "Don't let the opportunity pass you by.",
   "start": 51,
   "end": 53.16
  },
  {
   "text": "And then second, this is just one day of an amazing event.",
   "start": 53.22,
   "end": 57.72
  },
  {
   "text": "So tomorrow, things kick off again, right before 9:00 a.m.",
   "start": 57.78,
   "end": 61.5
  },
  {
   "text": "So make sure to get you ready early.",
   "start": 61.56,
   "end": 63.42
  },
  {
   "text": "Thank you all for coming.",
   "start": 63.48,
   "end": 64.56
  },
  {
   "text": "Thanks for having me, and see you tomorrow.",
   "start": 64.62,
   "end": 65.94
  },
